WEBVTT

00:02:29.187 --> 00:02:32.106
The search for the praying mantis
became a gateway

00:02:32.148 --> 00:02:33.983
into a labyrinth of wonders

00:02:34.025 --> 00:02:37.236
in which every corner
had something new to discover

00:02:37.278 --> 00:02:38.779
and get inspired.

00:02:39.238 --> 00:02:42.700
These are portraits
of a variety of praying mantis

00:02:42.742 --> 00:02:45.119
specifically from
the rainforest of Brazil.

00:02:45.578 --> 00:02:47.788
Which one do you identify with the most?

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:49.207
(Laughter)

00:02:49.248 --> 00:02:53.419
Each of them could easily be
a character in a sci-fi novel.

00:02:53.461 --> 00:02:56.297
Faces of the people from an exotic planet.

00:02:57.256 --> 00:03:00.259
But we share our planet
with these creatures.